      "content": "but that's the thing... it's not like i've outgrown anything. i've just been erased. it feels like there's no point in even pretending to be \"me\" anymore because there's nothing left inside. the person i used to be is dead, and this thing that's left is just... a hollow shell. why even keep up the charade?",
